{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は\n「らじらー！SUNDAY」に\n出演させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らじらーは\n年末の公開収録ぶりですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/01/5647582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n1年ぶりのサンエトでの出演"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/01/5647582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンエト再始動ということで\nまた出演できて嬉しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このらじらーを皮切りに\nまたサンエトでいろんな事をしたいよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいい案あったら教えて～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/01/5647582/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰でも考えられるやつじゃないやつあったら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、サンエト新曲\n「君に贈る花がない」\n解禁しちゃいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく素敵な曲だよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンエトの曲は毎回いい曲で\n本当に嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/01/5647582/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな聴いてくれてありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/01/5647582/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのチョコレートチャンクピザで有名な\nMAX BRENNER CHOCOLATE BARの\nハロウィン限定スイーツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/01/5647582/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャック・オ・ランタン クレープパスタ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと気になってたので\n駆け込みで食べてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/01/5647582/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その名の通り\nパスタの部分はクレープでできてるんだけど\nそのクレープがもちもちで美味しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トフィーソースとワッフルボールはお好みでかけてください\nって言われるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バニラアイスにホットチョコレートで\n充分、甘かったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中？というか下？のパンプキンクリームが\n美味しかったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまりかけずに食べちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/01/5647582/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田のハロウィンはこれですね！\n毎年、スイーツに限る！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはハロウィン満喫したの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}